<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5434] The current version of Jetty is known to have security vulnerabilities</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5434</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The current version of Jetty that is used by zeppelin:&#160;9.4.31.v20200723 - is known to have vulnerabilities. See &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/moqui/moqui-framework/issues/446&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; for more details. The recommended upgrade version is:&#160;9.4.42.v20210604&lt;/p&gt;</description>
